  "description": "Optional read-only cluster state API add-on for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes a transport-agnostic facade (and, via a sibling binding, a gRPC surface) that lets external clients query, observe, and subscribe to a cluster's tree state and metadata - trees, structure, entries, and views - for a tree-explorer dashboard and the Orleans.Lattice.Api.Mcp MCP server. Registered with a single AddLatticeStateApi(...) call.",
